          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b162524-r8daVAJ32H4j.png"
        },
        "description": "__Species:__ Human\n__Height:__ 167 cm (5'6\")\n__Peach Ability:__ Chains of Eternity, <i>\"Slave\"</i>\n__Affiliation:__ Anti-Demon Corps (7th Unit Chief)\n\nKyouka is the chief of the 7th Unit of the Anti-demon Corps, an elite group of women who have received power from the Peaches. She is [Yuuki Wakura](https://anilist.co/character/170329)'s savior and becomes his master after she decided to make him her slave. She is a fierce militaristic, calm, and serious woman befitting the 7th Unit Chief. She often fights against the Shuuki more seriously than other chiefs. She cares for the people around her to the point where she will do anything to protect them.",
